      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Not racing seriously, but one tune-up per block keeps it honest.</div><div><br/></div><ul><li>Apr 18 — Huckleberry Trail 10K (local, flat out-and-back). probably. right after UIST deadline though.</li><li>May 16 — downtown Roanoke 5K (night race?) — skip, NeurIPS aftermath.</li><li>Jun 6 — track mile at the summer series. for fun. goal sub-4:50.</li><li>Fall — half marathon w/ Owen. he wants something fast + flat in October. look at Bay Area options if the SF thing actually happens.</li></ul><div><br/></div><div>3/1: Owen says he's in for an October half wherever I end up. registration usually opens in June.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
